Testing [5. Face Attendance]: "how do I mark attendance?"
Reply: Here’s how you can mark your attendance:

1. **Open the Attendance Page** – From your dashboard, tap the **Attendance** icon or the “Attendance” link.

2. **Select Your Course** – If you’re enrolled in multiple courses, choose the one for which you want to mark attendance.

3. **Scan the Session Code**  
   * Click the **Scan & Mark Attendance** button.  
   * Your device camera will open; simply point it at the QR code shown on the faculty’s screen (or the QR code the faculty posted for that session).  
   * If you’re in a location without camera access, you can type the session code manually in the provided field.

4. **Confirm** – Once the QR code (or session code) is accepted, the system will register you as **Present** for that session.

That’s it! Your attendance record will update instantly and be visible on your profile. If you’re having trouble scanning, make sure your camera permissions are granted and that the QR code is clear. Good luck!

